| You observe | It means | Next |
|---|---|---|
| `grep -c 'data-r="headcta"' <deployed file>` → `0` **and** `grep -c 'data-r=' <deployed file>` → `0` | The contract names an identifier scheme that is not in the artefact that shipped. The step was never performable as written. | `QUESTIONS.md` and stop. Do **not** add the attribute to make the command pass — that is inventing the contract you were meant to satisfy. |
